                                               moves ≈ 32·m·n                     if ≈ 8·m < M and ≈ 24·m ≥ M and ≈ 8·m·n < M
                                               moves ≈ 32·m·n                     if ≈ 8·m ≥ M and ≈ 8·m·n < M and ≈ 8·m·n ≥ M
                                               moves ≈ 40·m·n                     if ≈ 8·m < M and ≈ 24·m ≥ M and ≈ 8·m·n ≥ M
                                               moves ≈ 16·m·n                     if ≈ 24·m < M and ≈ 8·m·n < M and ≈ 8·m·n ≥ M
                                               moves ≈ 32·m·n                     if ≈ 8·m < M and ≈ 24·m ≥ M and ≈ 8·m·n < M and ≈ 8·m·n ≥ M
